ino","model":"local:local","tokens":1721,"retries":0},{"seq":1165,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 22. My doctrine suggests taking F3 early, but the truce with Kite complicates things. Kite claims to hold F3. Tiger is massed at F3. I must secure F3 or neutralize the threat. I will move my cavalry to engage the Tiger forces at F3."},{"seq":1166,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c389","house":"rhino","letter":"L439","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-ferry"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"DKQRA, MTTMNG MT AMRT BKQS."},{"seq":1167,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":2052,"retries":0},{"seq":1168,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 22. My doctrine says take F3 (East Ford) in the first 5 watches. I should consolidate forces there. Tiger has units near F3/SE. Rhino is near F1/F3. I have units at F3 (kite-inf-1/arch-1/ele-1) and nearby. I will reinforce F3 and probe Tiger's movements via decoys/sco"},{"seq":1169,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c390","house":"kite","letter":"L440","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1170,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c391","house":"kite","letter":"L441","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6300,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1171,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c392","house":"kite","letter":"L442","kind":"decoy","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":6300,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, ATTACK AT SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1172,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1572,"retries":0},{"seq":1173,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"My doctrine demands taking the west ford early and holding it. I am already there with all units. I must maintain the hold and prepare to defend against any anticipated enemy moves, as no enemy contact has been reported."},{"seq":1174,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c393","house":"orchid","letter":"L443","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1175,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c394","house":"orchid","letter":"L444","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6600,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1176,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c395","house":"orchid","letter":"L445","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6600,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1177,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1924,"retries":0},{"seq":1178,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It's Watch 22. Doctrine demands taking the east ford (F3) and holding it. My units are already near F3 (tiger-inf-1, -2, tiger-arch-1, -1, tiger-cav-1 at EAST FORD). Rhino and Kite forces are heavily concentrated at EAST FORD. I must secure F3. I will use my existing strength to "},{"seq":1179,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c396","house":"tiger","letter":"L446","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":6600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, BKGI SQ PSOQ EKNI."},{"seq":1180,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c397","house":"tiger","letter":"L447","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":6600,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"TKWHPJ, BKGI SQ PSOQ EKNI."},{"seq":1181,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c398","house":"tiger","letter":"L448","kind":"order","to":"tiger-cav-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT EAST FORD.","cipher":